Z||000007||lou_dias||08-29-2001||08:37 AM||||Don't get Dragonball confused with Dragonball Z.<P>Dragon ball is gearer towards ages 5 and up and is about Goku as a little boy.<P>Dragonball Z is geared towards early teens and is about Goku as an adult.<P>In Japan, there is Dragonball GT also and that is supposed to come over here AFTER Dragonball Z.<P>Both are hilarious at times.  More so Dragonball than Dragonball Z as it's for kids.<P>Sayens are a warrior race of human-like being that are born with tails and when they look at a full moon they transform into giant apes.  Also, everytime they fight and are beaten to near death, after they have recovered from that they come back 1  or 2 levels stronger than before.  They are at the point now where they can destroy the whole planet with one energy blast.<P>They had their tails permanently removed becaue it was their one weakness/strength.  It allowed them to turn into giant apes, but when you grabbed it, they would scream in pain.<P>DBZ (Dragonball Z) kicks ass!  They characters in it all have distinct personalities and the plots are awesome and the action is incredible.<P>If anyone is interested, Dragonball is on the cartoon network a 5:30pm and DBZ is on at 6:00 and 6:30  DBZ merchandise is the #1 seller in the US right now, but unlike the other fads like the Power Rangers and Pokemon and all those other wussy shows, DBZ was written for MEN.  It's all about kicking ARSE!||||reg||1
